    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to bring to the market this fine two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment which is securely positioned on the second floor with lift access and comes with a balcony offering that all important outdoor space. This property comes with a `B` energy rating, is well presented and has one non-designated parking space. Highly convenient location close to LUAS stop and wide choice of amenities and facilities. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, living/dining room, kitchen, two bedrooms, ensuite shower room and family bathroom. There is also a balcony which is access from the living room. (see images which also include some which are virtually staged to show rooms potential when furnished) \n\nHighly convenient location with the property located close to a superb range of amenities including a Spar store and creche on the ground floor of the development and those at the nearby Citywest shopping centre & Business Park. A short drive will take you to Saggart Village, The Square shopping centre and the award-winning Avoca food market. There are also a good choice of local schools and recreational facilities. Excellent transport links with LUAS stop within walking distance, several public bus routes servicing the area and access to N7, N81 and M50 road networks are all just minutes` drive away. \n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nTotal Floor Area: 60sq.m (646sq.ft.) approx. \n\nENTRANCE HALL: L-shaped: 1.30m x 2.40m + 1.82m x 1.11m\nL-shaped hallway with walk-in storage press with shelving. \n\nLIVING/DINING ROOM: 3.73m x 6.12m\nSpacious reception room with large bank of windows offering plenty of natural light and door to balcony. Laminate wood flooring. \n\nKITCHEN: 3.72m x 1.48m\nFully fitted kitchen with range of floor units and wall shelving. Gas hob, electric oven, extractor hood, round stainless-steel sink and drainer, tiled splashback, integrated dishwasher, plumber for washing machine, tiled floor. \n\nBEDROOM 1: 3.28m x 3.49m\nDouble room, large window, fitted wardrobes, laminate wood flooring. \n\nENSUITE SHOWER ROOM: 2.19m x 1.17m\nShower cubicle , Electric shower, part tiled walls, tiled floor, wash hand basin and w.c..\n\nBEDROOM 2: 2.59m x 3.49m \nSpacious room with fitted wardrobe, laminate wood flooring. \n\nBATHROOM: 2.20m x 2.06m \nBath, overhead shower attachment, wash hand basin, w.c., partially tile walls, tiled floor, shaving light, wall mounted shelves and toiletries cabinet. \n\nOUTSIDE: \nBalcony access from living room. (3.09m x 1.32m approx.).\n\nGENERAL POINTS: SERVICES: UTILITIES:\nBER: B\nBER Number: 119692192 \nEnergy performance indicator:127.36 kWh/m2/yr\nGas Combi Boiler\nDouble glazed windows\nCar parking space\nBroadband available \n\nManagement Company: Belfry Hall Management company\nService charge 1582.96 p.a.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious two bed, two bath apartment </li><li> Impressive `B` energy rating </li><li> Balcony </li><li> Lift access </li><li> Securely positioned on the second floor </li><li> Parking </li><li> Combi gas boiler </li><li> Creche & Shop within the development </li><li> Close to Citywest Shopping Centre and a wide range of amenities/facilities </li><li> LUAS stop, Bus Routes, access to M50/N7/N81 road networks all within easy reach</li></ul>"
      },
