      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "EIRCODE:D24K095\nTraveling along the Blessington Road coming from the direction of Tallaght, take the right hand turn onto Citywest Road. On reaching the roundabout, take the third exit off to the right. At the next roundabout again take the third turn to the right and you will find the Belfry Hall development on the right-hand side easily identified by the Spar Store on the ground floor level. \n"
